17:05:16,435 openai._base_client DEBUG HTTP Response: POST http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1/chat/completions "200 OK" Headers({'content-type': 'application/json', 'date': 'Thu, 30 Jul 2026 16:05:15 GMT', 'content-length': '650'})
